# JOURNEY · a cheat code: type it into /cheat, get what it promised, and keep the Cheatfish it leaves.
# Performed by tests/journeys.rs at every size in JOURNEY_SIZES, 100×30 down to 40×14.
# By hand: cargo run --example fishplay -- tests/journeys/enter-a-cheat-code.play --size 40 14 --print

clear
run /cheat
expect Enter cheat code
absent ENTER cheat
type show me the mone
expect invalid cheat code
snap a code with a typo is refused before ENTER
type y
expect ENTER cheat
absent invalid cheat code
snap a real code offers ENTER
key enter
absent Enter cheat code

run /index
expect Cheatfish
snap the cheat left a Cheatfish in the tank
key esc

run /cheat
type bend the light
key enter
expect ∞
snap an endless purse reads as infinity

run /cheat
type fish to the fishtank
key enter
expect godmode
snap godmode is named on the status bar
